{"line":"T31.C.02.1","text":"Navajo als Code ist ein perfekter Thrindel. Er funktionierte, weil fast niemand die Sprache sprach. Jeder zusätzliche Sprecher, besonders auf der Seite des Feindes, machte ihn weniger nützlich. Als gewöhnliche Sprache ist es umgekehrt: Mehr Sprecher machen sie nützlicher. Du hast den Fall gefunden, in dem ein und dieselbe Sache umkippt.","lufs":-19.38,"alignment":{"characters":["N","a","v","a","j","o"," ","a","l","s"," ","C","o","d","e"," ","i","s","t"," ","e","i","n"," ","p","e","r","f","e","k","t","e","r"," ","T","h","r","i","n","d","e","l","."," ","E","r"," ","f","u","n","k","t","i","o","n","i","e","r","t","e",","," ","w","e","i","l"," ","f","a","s","t"," ","n","i","e","m","a","n","d"," ","d","i","e"," ","S","p","r","a","c","h","e"," ","s","p","r","a","c","h","."," ","J","e","d","e","r"," ","z","u","s","ä","t","z","l","i","c","h","e"," ","S","p","r","e","c","h","e","r",","," ","b","e","s","o","n","d","e","r","s"," ","a","u","f"," ","d","e","r"," ","S","e","i","t","e"," ","d","e","s"," ","F","e","i","n","d","e","s",","," ","m","a","c","h","t","e"," ","i","h","n"," ","w","e","n","i","g","e","r"," ","n","ü","t","z","l","i","c","h","."," ","A","l","s"," ","g","e","w","ö","h","n","l","i","c","h","e"," ","S","p","r","a","c","h","e"," ","i","s","t"," ","e","s"," ","u","m","g","e","k","e","h","r","t",":"," ","M","e","h","r"," ","S","p","r","e","c","h","e","r"," ","m","a","c","h","e","n"," ","s","i","e"," ","n","ü","t","z","l","i","c","h","e","r","."," ","D","u"," ","h","a","s","t"," ","d","e","n"," ","F","a","l","l"," ","g","e","f","u","n","d","e","n",","," ","i","n"," ","d","e","m"," ","e","i","n"," ","u","n","d"," ","d","i","e","s","e","l","b","e"," ","S","a","c","h","e"," ","u","m","k","i","p","p","t","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.08,0.16,0.24,0.32,0.4,0.48,0.56,0.64,0.72,0.8,0.88,0.96,1.04,1.12,1.2,1.28,1.36,1.44,1.52,1.56,1.6,1.64,1.68,1.744,1.808,1.872,1.936,2,2.08,2.16,2.213,2.267,2.32,2.38,2.44,2.5,2.56,2.613,2.667,2.72,2.